  "title": "Make-Ahead Spinach Salad in a Jar",
  "description": "Prep these salads once and eat for the week! Make sure to firmly pack the spinach into each jar and they will stay fresh all week. Also a great use for leftover quinoa!",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-06-06T21:20:15-04:00",
